<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Dashboardctl</title><link>https://cloudpunks.github.io/dashboardctl/</link><description>Recent content on Dashboardctl</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 01:16:29 +0200</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://cloudpunks.github.io/dashboardctl/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>About</title><link>https://cloudpunks.github.io/dashboardctl/about/</link><pubDate>Wed, 04 May 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://cloudpunks.github.io/dashboardctl/about/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;TBD&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Getting Started</title><link>https://cloudpunks.github.io/dashboardctl/getting-started/</link><pubDate>Fri, 20 May 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://cloudpunks.github.io/dashboardctl/getting-started/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;TBD&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Building</title><link>https://cloudpunks.github.io/dashboardctl/building/</link><pubDate>Tue, 03 May 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://cloudpunks.github.io/dashboardctl/building/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;We use &lt;a href="https://mise.jdx.dev/"&gt;mise&lt;/a&gt; to manage all required tools and their versions. Install it&#10;by following the &lt;a href="https://mise.jdx.dev/getting-started.html"&gt;official installation instructions&lt;/a&gt;, then run&#10;the following commands inside the repository to activate mise and install all&#10;tools defined in &lt;code&gt;mise.toml&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-txt" data-lang="txt"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;mise trust&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;mise install&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Since all required commands ar part of our &lt;a href="https://taskfile.dev/installation/"&gt;go-task&lt;/a&gt; taskfile the&#10;commands you got to execute are quite simple:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-txt" data-lang="txt"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;git clone https://github.com/cloudpunks/dashboardctl.git&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;cd dashboardctl&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;task build&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Finally you should have the binary within the &lt;code&gt;bin/&lt;/code&gt; folder now, give it a try&#10;with &lt;code&gt;./bin/dashboardctl -h&lt;/code&gt; to see all available options.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>License</title><link>https://cloudpunks.github.io/dashboardctl/license/</link><pubDate>Tue, 03 May 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://cloudpunks.github.io/dashboardctl/license/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;This project is licensed under the &lt;a href="https://github.com/cloudpunks/dashboardctl/blob/master/LICENSE"&gt;Apache 2.0&lt;/a&gt; license. For the&#10;license of the used libraries you have to check the respective sources.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>